SOAPBOX: I vacillated considerably about my commitment and goals for this test
SOAPBOX: because of competition from outdoor projects. The goal ultimately
SOAPBOX: became 1000 QSOs across 6 bands.
SOAPBOX: I did most of my operating during late afternoon and evening but did
SOAPBOX: not stay up past normal bedtime.
SOAPBOX: I failed to check nighttime on 20 so I missed Asia and Oceania, except
SOAPBOX: for one KH6.
SOAPBOX: 15 meters was weird: very low activity but some of the Europeans were
SOAPBOX: very loud, even towards evening. 20 meters was always open when I
SOAPBOX: looked. Worked a few US and South Americans on 10 meters. Worked
SOAPBOX: 9A1A on 160.
